from runtime import solve, realize
from prose import render_book

BOOK = {'openings': [{'text': 'Pip the young dragon clutched a sealed message and bounced beside Nia’s kite table. “Aunt Ember must see my dragon drawing!” he said. Nia eyed the {phrase:kite.tail_material} on the bright kite and held up a feather. “First, let’s discover what this little mark actually says.”', 'when': [{'key': 'message.mark', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'dragon', 'at': 'initial'}, {'key': 'mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'private', 'at': 'initial'}]}, {'text': 'Pip had a sealed message, a daring idea, and absolutely no patience. Nia had a kite and a strong preference for {phrase:nia.safe_preference}. Near Aunt Ember’s mailbox, they spotted a gathering. “If everyone is watching,” said Pip, “perhaps this message needs a sky-sized hello!”', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'public', 'at': 'initial'}]}, {'text': 'A tiny mark on Pip’s sealed message looked like a dragon, but Nia leaned closer. “That may not mean what you think,” she said. The kite waited on the table, its {phrase:kite.tail_material} drooping like a sleepy noodle, while Aunt Ember’s mailbox stood quietly beyond the hill.', 'when': [{'key': 'message.mark', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'weather', 'at': 'initial'}, {'key': 'mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'private', 'at': 'initial'}]}, {'text': 'Pip hugged his sealed message and pointed at the tiny gathering mark. “Pip guessed Aunt Ember was getting a dragon drawing!” he declared. Nia glanced at the {phrase:kite.tail_material} on the bright kite. “First, let’s find out whether this quiet mailbox wants a private hello.”', 'when': [{'key': 'message.mark', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'gathering', 'at': 'initial'}, {'key': 'mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'private', 'at': 'initial'}]}], 'scenes': [{'scene': 'inspect_message', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia bent over the sealed message and discovered a tiny weather mark stamped beneath the flap. “It says weather,” she announced. Pip blinked. His dragon drawing suddenly felt as if it had wandered into the wrong story.', 'when': [{'key': 'nia.knows.message.mark', 'op': 'ne', 'value': None, 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'message.mark', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'weather', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'Nia squinted at the seal and discovered a dragon mark, curled horns and all. “There’s your dragon,” she said. Pip puffed a pleased little smoke ring.', 'when': [{'key': 'nia.knows.message.mark', 'op': 'ne', 'value': None, 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'message.mark', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'dragon', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'Nia found a gathering mark on the message: three dots beneath a fluttering pennant. “This one is meant for people together,” she said, and Pip’s eyes grew round.', 'when': [{'key': 'nia.knows.message.mark', 'op': 'ne', 'value': None, 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'message.mark', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'gathering', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'inspect_audience', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia peered past the workshop and discovered a quiet mailbox with nobody nearby. “Private,” she whispered. Pip hugged the message close.', 'when': [{'key': 'nia.knows.mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'private', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'Nia looked toward Aunt Ember’s mailbox and discovered children gathering beside it, waving paper kites. “Public!” she cried. Pip’s tail gave an excited thump.', 'when': [{'key': 'nia.knows.mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'public', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'tell_mark', 'role': 'bridge', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia shared the mark’s meaning, and Pip listened with one smoky eyebrow raised.', 'when': [{'key': 'pip.knows.message.mark', 'op': 'ne', 'value': None, 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'tell_audience', 'role': 'bridge', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia told Pip who waited by the mailbox; Pip glanced from the quiet path to the lively crowd.', 'when': [{'key': 'pip.knows.mailbox.audience', 'op': 'ne', 'value': None, 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'choose_thread', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'For the private flight, Nia chose blue thread. Pip poked it. “A tail so skinny it needs a magnifying glass?” “A tail that lets the kite rise,” said Nia.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.selected_tail', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'thread', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'choose_feather', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia chose the soft feather for the private flight. Pip held it up. “A bird borrowed its best idea!” The feather tickled his nose, and he sneezed a tiny spark.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.selected_tail', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'feather', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'choose_ribbon', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'For the children’s gathering, Pip chose the red ribbon. “Grand swoop!” he declared. Nia tied a knot and watched the ribbon curl like a very fancy dragon moustache.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.selected_tail', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'ribbon', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'hand_kite_to_pip', 'role': 'bridge', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia placed the bright kite in Pip’s claws. He held it as solemnly as a royal pancake.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.owner', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'pip', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'hand_message_to_nia', 'role': 'bridge', 'variants': [{'text': 'Pip handed Nia the sealed message. “You found the mark,” he said. “You help me give it the right words.”', 'when': [{'key': 'message.owner', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'nia', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'rewrite_dragon', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Because the mailbox was private and the mark was dragon, Nia and Pip made a bright dragon drawing. Pip added three whiskers. “One for courage, one for sparkle, and one for sneezing,” he said.', 'when': [{'key': 'message.text_kind', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'dragon_drawing', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'rewrite_weather', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'The weather mark changed their plan. Pip traded his dragon drawing for a useful weather note, complete with a sun, two clouds, and one enormous raindrop wearing boots.', 'when': [{'key': 'message.text_kind', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'weather_note', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'rewrite_sky', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'With children gathered nearby, the message became a sky cheer. Pip drew a grinning dragon; Nia added bright letters underneath: “HELLO, CLOUD FRIENDS!”', 'when': [{'key': 'message.text_kind', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'sky_cheer', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'attach_tail', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Together they tied the chosen {phrase:kite.tail_material} to the kite. The bright paper wings shivered, as if the kite had just heard a marvelous secret.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.tail_attached', 'op': 'eq', 'value': True, 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'tuck_message', 'role': 'bridge', 'variants': [{'text': 'Nia tucked the finished message into the kite’s little pocket, and Pip patted it twice.', 'when': [{'key': 'message.tucked', 'op': 'eq', 'value': True, 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'invite_shared_flight', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Pip looked at the children, then at Nia. “Will you fly with me?” Nia smiled and took the blue thread. “Only if the kite gets a proper bow.” It did.', 'when': [{'key': 'nia.agrees.public_flight', 'op': 'eq', 'value': True, 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'launch_kite', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'At the quiet hill, Pip ran. The kite lifted toward Aunt Ember’s private mailbox, carrying its tucked message. The thread hummed, and Pip’s feet nearly forgot to touch the ground.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.airborne', 'op': 'eq', 'value': True, 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'private', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'launch_public_kite', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'Pip and Nia ran together. The red ribbon pulled the kite into a grand, low swoop above the children. Everyone cheered before the kite had even finished its first loop.', 'when': [{'key': 'kite.airborne', 'op': 'eq', 'value': True, 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'mailbox.audience', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'public', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'deliver_private', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'The private kite reached Aunt Ember’s mailbox. A green reply flag lifted. Pip’s dragon drawing had arrived, and the quiet path suddenly seemed full of invisible wings.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'green_flag', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'The kite delivered its weather note to the private mailbox. A silver sun appeared on the reply flag. Pip stared at it, then drew a second sun in the air with one glowing claw.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'silver_sun', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'deliver_weather', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'The kite carried the weather note safely, even in its low wobbling flight. Aunt Ember’s mailbox answered with a silver sun. Nia smiled as the kite bobbed like an honest little boat.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'silver_sun', 'at': 'after'}]}]}, {'scene': 'deliver_public', 'role': 'beat', 'variants': [{'text': 'The sky cheer sailed above the gathering. The children shouted it back, and Aunt Ember’s mailbox flashed a cheerful reply. The red ribbon curled around the blue thread like a dancing dragon.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'cheer', 'at': 'after'}]}]}], 'endings': [{'text': 'The feather-tail kite trembled above the hill like a tiny bird waving. Below, Pip’s grin shone brighter than the quiet mailbox’s green flag.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'green_flag', 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'kite.tail_material', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'feather', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'The blue thread quivered, the green reply flag lifted, and Pip’s private dragon drawing went on its way. Nia tucked the leftover spark into her pocket.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'green_flag', 'at': 'after'}, {'key': 'kite.tail_material', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'thread', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'The weather kite wobbled low and true while a silver sun gleamed on Aunt Ember’s reply. Nia smiled; even the kite seemed pleased with its honest little wobble.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'silver_sun', 'at': 'after'}]}, {'text': 'Above the children, the red ribbon curled around the blue thread like a dancing dragon. Their cheers tugged the sky cheer higher and higher.', 'when': [{'key': 'mailbox.reply', 'op': 'eq', 'value': 'cheer', 'at': 'after'}]}], 'lexicon': [{'key': 'kite.tail_material', 'value': 'none', 'text': 'no tail'}, {'key': 'kite.tail_material', 'value': 'thread', 'text': 'blue thread'}, {'key': 'kite.tail_material', 'value': 'ribbon', 'text': 'red ribbon'}, {'key': 'kite.tail_material', 'value': 'feather', 'text': 'soft feather'}, {'key': 'nia.safe_preference', 'value': 'thread', 'text': 'blue thread'}, {'key': 'nia.safe_preference', 'value': 'feather', 'text': 'soft feather'}]}

def render(run, rng):
    return render_book(run, rng, BOOK)

def generate(seed, prose_seed=None):
    return realize(solve(build(seed), seed), render, seed if prose_seed is None else prose_seed)
